    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Chase DeLauter has been named an AL Silver Slugger Award winner. He's the first Cleveland rookie to earn the honor and the first Cleveland player not named José Ramírez to do so since Carlos Santana in 2019.",
      "likes": 76,
      "reposts": 13,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-17T23:34:30.219Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2k7f242ck2g",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "チェイス・デローターがア・リーグのシルバースラッガー賞を受賞。クリーブランドの新人としては初、ホセ・ラミレス以外の選手では2019年のカルロス・サンタナ以来の受賞"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Down in the Dominican Winter League (LIDOM) … and I can not stress enough that this is a tweet about the Dominican Winter League (LIDOM): Vladimir Guerrero Jr. was traded from Toros del Este to Tigres del Licey. Guerrero has not played in LIDOM games since 2020-21. #BlueJays",
      "likes": 53,
      "reposts": 4,
      "replies": 4,
      "at": "2026-11-18T01:51:36.645Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2kh27gnh22p",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "They might try change the name to the Tigres Centre, but it’ll always be called the LIDOMe",
          "likes": 3,
          "author": "bradc.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Vladimir Guerrero Jr. traded!!!!!1!!!!\n\n(God, does putting a random 1 into a block of !s even scan any more?)",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "cannedlizard.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Shatkins!",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "buck16.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "What did the Bulls get in return? Was the purpose of this trade entirely so they could freak out Blue Jays fans by announcing \"Guerrero traded to Tigers\"?",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "chamale.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "ドミニカ・ウィンターリーグ(LIDOM)の話題です。念押ししますが、LIDOMの話です。ブラディミール・ゲレーロJr.がトロス・デル・エステからティグレス・デル・リセイへトレード。LIDOMでの出場は2020-21年以来ありません #BlueJays"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "I cannot wait until some drunk dude demolishes a pitch and reaches the actual field",
      "likes": 35,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 5,
      "at": "2026-11-17T18:01:10.156Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2jmqykpo22v",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "How I’m pulling up to blow 90 mph gyroballs past some kids after a couple steady eddies during BP",
          "likes": 9,
          "author": "oriolebird.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "let’s go hit some tanks!",
          "likes": 4,
          "author": "chrpngbrd.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "At Memorial Stadium, the tarp crew had to arrive on Saturdays at 7AM for games that started at 730PM. We used to play 100-inning wiffleball games in the bullpen, hitting balls off the big scoreboard. 🖤🧡⚾️",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "fistsofham.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "But what if a sober dude does it?",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "thinkingmansgame.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "酔っ払いが球を豪快に打ち返して本物のグラウンドまで届かせる日が待ちきれない"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Tigres del Licey is the club where Vladdy's father, Vladimir Guerrero, took the final professional at-bats of his Hall of Fame career (2012-'13 LIDOM season). It also brings me great joy to report that a 41-year-old Emilio Bonifacio is playing right field for Tigres. #BlueJays",
      "likes": 29,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-18T02:40:16.586Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2kjra4abs2v",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ティグレス・デル・リセイは、父ブラディミール・ゲレーロが殿堂入りキャリア最後の打席に立ったクラブ(2012-13年シーズン)。41歳のエミリオ・ボニファシオが右翼を守っているのも、うれしい報告です #BlueJays"
    },
    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "The Twins needed a starting catcher this offseason. Surprising that it’s Ryan Jeffers, but reinforces their decision not to trade him in August. Jeffers becomes the highest-paid player on the Twins’ roster for next year too.",
      "likes": 25,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-17T21:27:43.437Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2jycdpk7k2l",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ツインズは今オフ、正捕手が必要だった。ライアン・ジェファーズというのは意外だが、8月に放出しなかった判断を裏づける形に。来季のツインズでは最高年俸の選手にもなる"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
